5. Conclusion
In this paper, we proposed a novel maneuvering target tracking algorithm with random motion model based on random coefficient matrices Kalman filtering. Numerical examples show that this new algorithm performed better and more stable than the tradition single model algorithm and the IMM with wrong model sets. Combining IMM and the random motion model, we proposed a new multi-model algorithm for maneuvering target tracking. The performance of IRIMM is almost the same as that of IMM with right model set. It can significantly improve the
